WEBVTT

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:33.420
He's moving.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:35.800
We got him!

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:42.350
The ultimate low-recoil automatic weapon for close-range combat, the AK-74,

00:00:42.350 --> 00:00:46.270
is helpless at the firing range of the gun the professor developed.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:48.270
Even if the guns are loaded with blanks,

00:00:48.270 --> 00:00:50.650
they're risking their lives in this battle.

00:00:50.650 --> 00:00:55.780
This attack has caused the experienced mercenaries to become more cautious.

00:00:56.490 --> 00:00:59.240
They're trying to slow him down with the next generation of the famous G-3,

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:04.120
the German G-36, and the English version of the FAL,

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:08.880
and then finish them off with the M-16,
which excels in close quarters combat.

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:26.100
The Savines have mastered the multi-scope the professor developed.

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:31.320
The bullet encounters air resistance as it travels, and descends as it goes forward.

00:01:31.320 --> 00:01:34.320
In other words, the travel distance depends upon the angle of fire.

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:40.120
By calculating the position of the target with a laser sight and digitally displaying it,

00:01:40.870 --> 00:01:43.910
even difficult long-range shots become possible.

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:47.000
Add a digital compass to that,

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:51.130
and then an infrared scope to allow the rifle to be used during both night and day.

00:01:51.130 --> 00:01:54.880
The professor was a genius in developing that super-sight.

00:02:12.020 --> 00:02:17.110
Impressive, you are truly the best mercenaries in France, the Savine Brothers.

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:21.320
You've done very well in using the assault rifles I put my blood and sweat into developing,

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:29.080
the XM-29 and F-2000, to defeat the world's four great assault rifles.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:38.340
You will introduce my modified guns to the world.

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:41.840
And bury the obsolete M-16...

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:49.390
Along with Golgo.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:54.270
And we'll be the strongest snipers in the world.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:01.860
If Golgo takes the bait, we'll know in ten days.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:24.220
I held my breath and kept waiting while my heart was scratched away

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:35.570
A minute, a second never felt so long

00:03:36.070 --> 00:03:47.330
I look up at the sky and ask the wind, "Can I fly now?"

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:53.620
The weak person I was is no more

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:59.210
I decided to just believe

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:06.350
With the dreams I once had in my hand now

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:10.180
I go towards you

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:17.900
Carrying those emotions I felt when I broke

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:22.030
I go towards you

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:26.070
Blown by the wind

00:04:26.820 --> 00:04:31.540
Oh blown

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:38.000
The Masterpiece Assault Rifle

00:04:56.230 --> 00:05:00.400
The two guns being fired now are modified guns sent by Kaizer.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:06.450
Are these truly the most suitable weapons for the Future Force Warrior plan,

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:14.750
the next generation integrated infantry combat system?

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:22.340
The recoil is minimal, and the accuracy percentage is extremely high.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:24.340
That's not an answer, Colonel.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:28.050
It's certain that these two guns are impressive.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:30.180
They're wonderful guns.

00:05:30.180 --> 00:05:31.100
But...

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:32.850
But... what?

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:38.560
The true potential of these guns can only be proved with actual combat.

00:05:41.940 --> 00:05:43.820
If, as Kaizer says,

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.740
they were able to defeat Golgo 13 with these guns,

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:50.240
the entire world would recognize their potential.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:33.080
French cars fit the city of Paris well.

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:35.200
But look at that!

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.080
Japanese cars are taking over like a virus!

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:42.750
The spread of Japanese cars is polluting the traditions of Europe!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.090
Slowly.

00:06:48.800 --> 00:06:49.680
Yes.

00:06:55.810 --> 00:06:59.560
In a world-famous rally to be held ten days from now,

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:04.480
Japanese cars are projected to win.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:10.320
If that happens, my country's domestic automobile industry will be finished!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:15.830
The course is the same every year,

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:18.040
so I'd like you to wait at this point,

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:21.170
here in the Tenere desert in Niger, and snipe the Japanese cars.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:27.880
This curve is a high-speed corner that's taken at over 200 kilometers per hour.

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:32.680
If you aim here, you can deal a fatal blow to the car.

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:36.220
You want me to burst a tire on the high-speed corner?

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:37.350
That's right.

00:07:37.350 --> 00:07:40.310
The car will roll over and won't be able to get back in the race.

00:07:41.690 --> 00:07:44.770
But we can't have any proof left.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.360
You're the only one who can snipe the tires

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:51.900
of a high-speed car that's throwing up dust without leaving any bullet fragments.

00:07:53.700 --> 00:07:56.240
Please, Mr. Tougou.

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.240
Please tell me you'll do it.

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:27.900
It's been a while.

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:31.990
I'm happy to be able to work with you again, Mr. Tougou.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:39.830
Do it in four days.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:44.290
That's a lot of time for one of your jobs.

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:49.130
Another engineer wouldn't be able to do it in a year.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:57.300
Have you heard about the custom assault rifles developed by Kaizer?

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.760
Yes.

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:00.930
He's a European arms merchant,

00:09:00.930 --> 00:09:04.310
known as a genius at developing custom weaponry.

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:08.060
I was invited to his factory.

00:09:09.860 --> 00:09:13.820
The history of the assault rifle stretches back to the MP-43,

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:21.160
a rifle developed by the German army at the end of WWII.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:26.250
From there, it developed into the Soviet AK-47,
the German G3,

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:31.170
the English FAL, and the American M-16.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:37.180
Then, the 1970s saw the development of the "Bullpup" assault rifle.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:40.470
The biggest difference between a bullpup assault rifle and, say,

00:09:40.470 --> 00:09:43.180
the M-16, is the integration of the mechanical firing mechanism into the gunstock.

00:09:44.140 --> 00:09:45.560
The advantage of this

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:50.110
is that the shorter gun allows for greater mobility, making it more suited to close quarters combat.

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:55.360
But the M-16 has been through many actual battles, beginning with Vietnam,

00:09:55.360 --> 00:10:02.080
and has been continually modified to the point where it is known as the "World's Masterpiece Gun."

00:10:02.080 --> 00:10:02.830
However...

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:04.660
However!

00:10:04.660 --> 00:10:09.330
The weapon I am going to announce today surpasses even the M-16,

00:10:09.330 --> 00:10:12.170
a masterpiece assault rifle!

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:32.270
I've customized the XM-29 and F-2000

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:40.160
and increased their abilities as assault rifles, and in addition, added a super-scope of my own design.

00:10:53.670 --> 00:11:00.630
I'm sure I will soon be able prove to you just how capable these assault rifles are.

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:10.940
The assault rifles were customized XM-29 and F-2000s, they were pretty impressive.

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:19.860
Golgo 13, the M-16 you're trying to create is also a masterpiece assault rifle, but...

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:37.170
I'm fine, seriously!

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:03.780
The accuracy of a gun is dependent upon the fine crafting of its chamber.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.030
The cylinders for the body, the chamber,

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:09.790
and the muzzle must match and have their center at exactly the same point,

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:13.750
and the barrel must be a perfectly straight line, or the bullet will not fly straight.

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:19.170
It all comes down to the chambering that I'm about to begin.

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:21.050
Machines can't do it.

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:24.970
I must put all of my senses, my many years of experience,

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:28.810
and talent to work, and do it by human hand.

00:12:32.350 --> 00:12:35.810
What a crazy request.

00:12:52.330 --> 00:12:54.830
I'm afraid I fell asleep.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:12:59.590
Switch it with the barrel of this gun.

00:15:03.420 --> 00:15:06.920
I'm sure even Golgo 13 is shocked;

00:15:07.380 --> 00:15:10.720
he was sniped at from even farther away than his own shot.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:12.930
We've cut off his escape routes,

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:16.600
even he can't possibly survive a protracted battle.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.930
Optimistic decisions create openings in our plan.

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:23.860
Golgo has the power to bring the abilities of the M-16 to its limits.

00:15:23.860 --> 00:15:28.610
The M-16 is no match for your super-sight, professor.

00:15:29.900 --> 00:15:31.110
Can you hear me?

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:36.240
Golgo 13 will most likely try to bring the battle to a closer range.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:39.710
You know how strong we are in those fights.

00:15:39.710 --> 00:15:42.460
You think he's like those punks you've fought before?

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:44.130
He's Golgo 13!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:47.130
Don't rush, my brother.

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.880
He will make his move soon.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:55.180
Indeed; he knows he's at a disadvantage in a long fight, too.

00:15:55.760 --> 00:15:57.390
The sun will set soon.

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:01.390
When that happens, we'll be at even more of an advantage.

00:16:01.390 --> 00:16:04.400
His sight isn't intended for night use.

00:16:04.400 --> 00:16:09.900
Now then, what will you do, Golgo 13?

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:46.150
What is he thinking?

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.400
Why don't you move, Golgo 13?

00:16:48.940 --> 00:16:52.400
He just can't, professor.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.830
He moved!

00:17:46.120 --> 00:17:46.580
The fool...

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.080
Don't underestimate it!

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:58.800
He can't do anything.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:17:59.720
W-What a terrifying man...

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:02.810
W-What a terrifying man...

00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:08.310
He learned four pieces of information in that confrontation.

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:13.320
The first is the number of enemies, the second, their location, the third, the capabilities of their rounds...

00:18:13.320 --> 00:18:15.320
T-Their rounds?

00:18:15.320 --> 00:18:17.320
The time it took for the bullet to reach its target.

00:18:17.320 --> 00:18:25.080
He knows that the bullets traveled 350 meters in 0.4 seconds; in other words, it's a 5.56 high speed round.

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:26.330
And the last piece of information?

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:37.010
From that automatic fire and sniping, the guns are bullpups; and an XM-29 and F-2000.

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.680
Impossible...

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:44.560
We'll have to rely on the Savine brothers' combat abilities.

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:47.560
He's in plain view with the super sight.

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:50.060
Now I'll test you.

00:18:50.060 --> 00:18:52.190
Roger, brother.

00:19:04.950 --> 00:19:06.240
Why?

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:07.950
Why are you moving, Golgo 13?

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:20.840
He's finally going to start to fight.

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.770
You're taking him out, brother?

00:19:33.770 --> 00:19:35.070
Yeah.

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:41.200
This distance is within my rifle's firing range, but outside that of his M-16.

00:19:41.200 --> 00:19:43.740
Let me take the first shot.

00:19:43.740 --> 00:19:44.740
Okay.

00:19:44.740 --> 00:19:46.490
But don't kill him.

00:19:46.490 --> 00:19:50.790
I'll give you the honor of killing Golgo 13, brother.

00:20:06.760 --> 00:20:07.470
Get down!

00:20:13.690 --> 00:20:17.690
Golgo moved so that the rally course would be at his back?

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:20.150
You bastard!

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:42.840
What's going on?

00:20:42.840 --> 00:20:51.480
Why did my bullets miss, and yours hit this far, Golgo...

00:20:55.270 --> 00:20:56.270
Why?

00:20:56.270 --> 00:20:59.400
Why did their bullets miss even with the super sight?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:00.320
It was the gradient...

00:21:00.320 --> 00:21:01.280
The gradient?

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:06.450
He took advantage of the sight's calibration memory's weak spot.

00:21:06.450 --> 00:21:10.290
That is, that shooting on a gradient is different than shooting on a flat surface

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.870
He defeated the younger brother via the car's headlights,

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:15.290
and the older by taking advantage of the gradient.

00:21:15.290 --> 00:21:18.290
What a terrifying man, Golgo 13.

00:21:45.570 --> 00:21:48.370
Tell me one thing...

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:52.240
How were you able to defeat the Savines from that range?

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:56.330
The M16A2 shouldn't be accurate at that distance!

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:58.170
I customized it...

00:21:58.170 --> 00:21:59.380
with a super-barrel.

00:21:59.380 --> 00:22:02.800
I never thought that a man who could create such a barrel existed.

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:09.800
An M16A2 custom...

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:13.520
That's the masterpiece assault rifle, huh?

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:49.680
Chiisana koto ni zenryoku ni naru kimi no sugata yuuki ni natta hibi

00:22:42.090 --> 00:22:49.680
Those days I saw you giving your all for small things filled me with courage

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:57.140
Zutto horyuu shippanashi jya ugokenai

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:57.140
If I keep them suspended then I won't be able to move

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:06.690
GARASU no HAIWEI ni tatteiru you ni

00:22:59.140 --> 00:23:06.690
It's like I'm standing on a glass highway

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.910
Yume to kiken to senaka awase demo

00:23:06.690 --> 00:23:13.910
Even if I'm standing back to back with dreams and danger

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:21.040
Kono nagai michi wo sukoshizutsu arukou

00:23:13.910 --> 00:23:21.040
I'll take this long road one step at a time

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:27.210
Soshite kimi wa ano koro mitai ni

00:23:21.040 --> 00:23:27.210
And I need you to smile

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:30.220
Waratteite

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:30.220
Like you did back then

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:36.850
Shiokaze ni yurete sasayakiatta

00:23:30.220 --> 00:23:36.850
It shook in the sea breeze and whispered

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:47.440
Kagayaiteita tooi ano hi wa kagerou

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:47.440
That distant and shining day is a shimmering haze

00:23:45.900 --> 00:23:49.320
The shining days

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:55.280
Tsumaranai koto ni makeru ni wa hayasugiru

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:55.280
I can't lose to something so trivial

00:24:02.080 --> 00:24:05.920
Golgo shot the Mafia boss "Marty."

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:11.090
Marty's lover, Linda, won her freedom.

00:24:11.090 --> 00:24:13.220
Her dreams and wishes came true,

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:14.720
but the next moment,

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:18.560
her gun is pointed at Golgo.

00:24:19.220 --> 00:24:20.390
Next time on Golgo 13:

00:24:21.140 --> 00:24:22.770
Pretty Woman.

00:24:21.180 --> 00:24:27.070
Pretty Woman

00:24:23.650 --> 00:24:27.610
Don't stand behind him, if you value your life.
